      <textAnnotation id="sid-ECB34CFF-17E2-4271-99F2-13E176E03C5B" signavio:alignment="left" textFormat="text/plain">
         <extensionElements>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#000000"/>
         </extensionElements>
         <text>After the requested modifications, it is therefore expected that approval will be granted at the next submission</text>
      </textAnnotation>
      <textAnnotation id="sid-713BF3F0-453D-4F9E-902D-DBBE6E4EFCC0" signavio:alignment="left" textFormat="text/plain">
         <extensionElements>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#000000"/>
         </extensionElements>
         <text>Each proposed modification must be evaluated by the ethical committee, as with the Clinical Research Department's trial proposal, to ensure ethical compliance and study integrity.</text>
      </textAnnotation>
      <textAnnotation id="sid-88C09904-F10A-4B7D-9A13-950B3DAAEEAA" signavio:alignment="left" textFormat="text/plain">
         <extensionElements>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#000000"/>
         </extensionElements>
         <text>Defines the study protocol: methodology, minimum number of participants, study objectives, etc.</text>
      </textAnnotation>
      <textAnnotation id="sid-2AC1FACF-60D2-4C3A-AFD5-23AA7680ADDE" signavio:alignment="left" textFormat="text/plain">
         <extensionElements>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#000000"/>
         </extensionElements>
         <text>Only to the
hospitals of 
the same congregation 
as the Initiator</text>
      </textAnnotation>
      <textAnnotation id="sid-913F9FBB-E4E7-45F4-8393-BC0A83A8DFA9" signavio:alignment="left" textFormat="text/plain">
         <extensionElements>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#000000"/>
         </extensionElements>
         <text>Only to hospitals that did not reject the invite</text>
      </textAnnotation>
   </process>
